  triage:description "boundaries/atm-storage-rusqlite/async-task-mutation-store-sqlite.toml:42, boundaries/atm-storage/task-store.toml -- the 2026-09-10 fix attempt asserted 'lint_rules, not review_gates, are the mechanically enforced controls' but this claim is FALSE. Independent re-verification at 6937c547f confirms: (1) .just/lint_boundaries.py validates syntax only (line 1518-1521 validates identifier strings), never executes any named lint rule; (2) grep -rn LINT-BOUNDARY-ASYNC-TASK-MUTATION-SQLITE .just/ returns zero hits outside the TOML declaration itself; (3) the attempted fix made enforcement worse by claiming false mechanical enforcement in the TOML notes field. STILL OPEN -- boundary governance is not mechanically enforced." ;
